<p>I see what your saying, and I gotta agree with you. Add that to the fact it is an anomaly, who knows how far the anomalous changes go. While it says its a A.I, it might well be able to &quot;feel&quot; emotions. Considering all the messed up and crazy SCP's out their, a A.I that can actually feel emotions isnt nearly that crazy sounding. But thats just my take on it, yours does fit within the logical bounds more, I just try to think on the edge.</p>

